  <item>
    <title>Vol.23【心理委员我不得劲！】——不打针，不吃药，坐这儿就是跟你唠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69db55a0e2c8be3155fde35c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69db55a0e2c8be3155fde35c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Apr 2026 08:25:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期节目是我和朋友们想聊聊心里那些“说不清道不明”的问题。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>焦虑、内耗、ADHD、情绪过山车，跟朋友们坐在一起才发现，原来我的这些“心病”大家都得过啊，所以这期播客分享给你们—我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播：江江 刘姐（酥酥） 王sir 小朱 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="151">00:02:31</a> 自测ADHD 悬着的一颗心终于死了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">00:12:46</a> 考试什么的都去死吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">00:17:37</a> 快乐小朱和吃不上鸡蛋灌饼的阿山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">00:19:49</a> 好学生面具下的情绪哑剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">00:24:46</a> 拼凑一个迟到的自我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">00:27:40</a> 学习内观 怎么样得劲我就怎样来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">00:32:19</a> 陌生环境里吾日三省吾表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">00:45:10</a> 当“反权威”成了我们的肌肉记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3054">00:50:54</a> ADHD发力了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3470">00:57:50</a> 当我的身体背叛我的意志 舞台成为审判场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3971">01:06:11</a> 心理分数大公开</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果每天都可以happy happy谁想要sad:))——陳嫺靜</span></p><span></span><p><span>找自己——陶喆</span></p><span></span><p><span>懒得去管——孙燕姿</span></p>]]></description>
