  <item>
    <title>Vol.22【生活碎记】——非穷尽列举，是无奈也是心酸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b179e984bce022f9f2866f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b179e984bce022f9f2866f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2026 14:28:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是看完《非穷尽列举》的超激动后冷却蒸馏的版本。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>⚠️警告⚠️本期包含《非穷尽列举》、《初步举证》、《混沌少年时》三部作品的大量剧透和情节讨论，如果介意可以看完再来听哦~~</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>生活碎记就是我超主观言论的表达，如果与你观点不同，欢迎留言讨论。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播:小朱 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">00:03:30</a> 有时我们无法诉说痛苦也很难说NO</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">00:06:47</a> 《初步举证》为我提供了更完整的受害者视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="748">00:12:28</a> 父位缺失可能才是紧张焦虑的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">00:16:28</a> 本能的第一性视角是可怕的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">00:23:03</a> Only yes means yes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1663">00:27:43</a> 故事情节绝望到像极了生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">00:31:00</a> 谁能摆脱男子气概啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">00:37:50</a> 也许儿子哈里的认罪是解放了杰西卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">00:42:57</a> 非穷尽列举的三层含义</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Process——Self Esteem</span></p><span></span><p><span>No Means No (Means No) ——Michelle Treacy</span></p><span></span><p><span>Time Will Tell——宇多田ヒカル</span></p>]]></description>
