  <item>
    <title>Vol.21【四季漫谈】——明媚的花和亮色的我就是春天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fab815623bc78c393b6f33</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fab815623bc78c393b6f33</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>这期播客是由我和小朱的闲谈以及鸟鸣、小朋友们的打闹哭笑的背景声共同组成的。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>花、风筝、浓烈或懵懂的情愫好像便是春天的味道，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>本期节目主播: 小朱 阿山</span></p></blockquote><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">00:05:32</a> 登台是我个人春天的时刻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">00:07:30</a> 在人生的春天里我是五光十色的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">00:12:54</a> 儿时的春天是天空中高高低低的风筝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">00:19:11</a> 买小众服饰、穿裙子是我感受春天的方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1445">00:24:05</a> 每过一年春天，我便独立一些</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">00:29:02</a> 我讨厌玉兰花都怪语文老师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">00:32:02</a> 春日巴黎爱情故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">00:47:05</a> 听着溪水叮叮咚咚，去采茶</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3061">00:51:01</a> 《春》片段节选——丰子恺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3128">00:52:08</a>《明月高悬夜空》——费尔南多·佩索阿</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——BryanTeoh</span></p><p><span>二十二——陶喆</span></p><p><span>春风吹——方大同</span></p><p><span>玉兰花——邰肇玫</span></p><p><span>April Front——松隆子 (松たか子)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6575e8ef28ad43a62b2dad7c/lrvz9_51MHIKr11SchNSc4_j_dG_.m4a" length="54386099" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhB2F-jYPhM4hfxqMOB0gNAHvbSj.png"/>
