  <item>
    <title>Vol.20【妇女节特辑】——她与她们</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cb4da50766616acd634e3c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cb4da50766616acd634e3c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是三八妇女节特别节目！“她”在我们每个人的生活中，“她”的故事也影响感染激励着我们每个人。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>也许这期节目会让你再次为“她”而感动，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播:酥酥 江江 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Ps.每个人难免会有偏见，但是请记得我们的名字——偏见都对，希望大家友善交流哦~~~</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">00:01:27</a> 我是一个正常的女性，我更是一个立体多样的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">00:10:15</a> 温和包容的女生朋友们让我了解到了男女之间的差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">00:14:52</a>什么叫你一个女孩怎么这么粗心？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1143">00:19:03</a> 脏话迷思：为什么都以女性为主体？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">00:20:31</a> 别管别人，可以不严肃可以哭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">00:27:07</a> 节育环让我明白女性不是抽象的概念，是经受痛苦的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">00:36:41</a>在职场中请相信我的专业度，在生活中请尊重我的隐私</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">00:42:46</a> 望周知，尊重比所谓“幽默”更有魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">00:52:52</a> 妈妈和我亦步亦趋，但她赶上了我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3740">01:02:20</a> 不再做被人爱的梦，而用充盈的情绪去感受爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3963">01:06:03</a> 别怕冲突，勇敢的去保护自己、保护“她”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4865">01:21:05</a> 我有权利选择美，但请你不要告诉我我必须美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5169">01:26:09</a> 无穷的远方，无数的女性都和我有关！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——BryanTeoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>她不再幻想——陈婧霏</span></p><span></span><p><span>1 in 3 (I’m Fine)——SelfEsteem</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chiquitita——ABBA</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6575e8ef28ad43a62b2dad7c/lvwP9LnjKLf0yeoXP6ccd2JSmkYs.m4a" length="92284426" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj7YG_oYbq2dFr6GI_IVayEwIDnM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.19【生活碎记】——哪吒和我，殷夫人和我妈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b4b84e05a90dfd0d59c9f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b4b84e05a90dfd0d59c9f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>这期播客是我看完《哪吒之魔童闹海》后的胡言乱语。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>⚠️警告⚠️本期包含电影大量剧透和情节讨论，如果介意可以看完电影再来听哦~~</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>生活碎记就是我超主观言论的阵地，如果与你观点不同，欢迎留言讨论。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>本期节目主播:阿山</span></p></blockquote><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">00:01:59</a> 看动画片怎么有现实主义的味道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">00:03:56</a> 魅力方言造就了可爱的角色</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">00:06:56</a> 总归要反叛，这次是反叛啥呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">00:09:25</a> 超雄小孩超自我，为家人有啥错啊到底！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">00:12:09</a> 殷夫人的原型人物就是我妈，我妈超爱我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">00:17:07</a> 相信直觉，直视本能，好好爱自己</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">00:18:00</a> 哪吒这电影也就一般，问题也不少（bushi</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">00:20:33</a> 新形式动画电影的想象</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——BryanTeoh</span></p><p><span>少年英雄小哪吒——杨采钰</span></p>]]></description>
