  <item>
    <title>Vol.18【年终杂谈】——2424不得了 ！精神大丰收 内耗被赶跑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67972d40d74435e4a30643d4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67972d40d74435e4a30643d4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是2025年1月1日凌晨录制的，我和俱乐部的朋友们一起聊了聊自己的2024年，也在嬉笑中开始了2025年。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2024年，我们有成就有突破也有更爱自己。希望你能听得开心！这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播：好好 辣辣 艺涵 小赵 vivi 魔术师小李 高兴 肖大王 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">00:02:22</a> 不管哪一年，就是想搞钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">00:04:55</a> 痛苦焦虑，还住乡下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">00:08:23</a> 星巴克冰摇红莓黑加仑的做法公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">00:09:39</a> 我穷但把自己养的很好！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">00:11:09</a> 大学生的生活谁能不羡慕呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">00:15:55</a> 我以魔术师的身份站在了刘谦老师旁边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">00:18:35</a> 什么边伯贤，华流才是最吊的（bushi</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">00:23:05</a> 三年期的哈啰单车年卡才300块这不值得骄傲吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">00:27:17</a> 顶级运营好好！都不酷的福气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">00:31:02</a> 跨年夜男朋友带我去吃三江源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">00:35:10</a> 2024年的遗憾难免关于爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">00:38:11</a> 想谈恋爱，想要有权利味道的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2502">00:41:42</a> 比较心动的男生都是gay，这种好事怎么跟高兴没关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">00:53:10</a> 夹带私货：给自己的一段话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3500">00:58:20</a> 2025年许愿大合集！新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>本日のおすすめ——離婚伝説</span></p><span></span><p><span>任我行——陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>侠客行——刘铁营/虞霞</span></p><span></span><p><span>Que Sera Sera——Billianne</span></p><span></span><p><span>想要的一定实现——上海彩虹室内合唱团</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6575e8ef28ad43a62b2dad7c/ln0mdyV9WQrxHST6-5mcHAB8SVE5.m4a" length="61840461" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpReOSSGNfTpk9l5n7rKCJDbDMsA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.17【四季漫谈】——不下雪不看纯爱电影就不是冬天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677cf3281962f0b751f77d4d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677cf3281962f0b751f77d4d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Jan 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是我再次遭受到江浙沪冬天魔法攻击的回击，想用记忆来对抗现实的寒冷。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>初雪、火锅、糖葫芦！圣诞、跨年、除夕夜！好在有这些，大家随着温度的降低反而更亲近。也许我们的分享能让你想起冬日美好时刻，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播: 西南桂林的酥酥 东北丹东的肖大王 西北嘉峪关的阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">00:02:30</a> 来了南方才发现，下雪要打伞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">00:08:36</a> 江浙沪的冬天必须要有30度的空调</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">00:12:47</a> 北方冬天的特色食物：酸菜、夹板肉、螺丝咸菜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgZ3HmFYpzpOHGw5ApV5ghzN_kaG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>螺丝咸菜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1383">00:23:03</a> 在甘肃吃个竹筒粽子很奇怪嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">00:28:25</a> 在北京我吃到了烫嘴的糖葫芦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2036">00:33:56</a> 寿喜锅、火锅、烤红薯！冬天就是要吃热气腾腾的食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">00:39:14</a> 冬日限定音效：踩雪的咯吱咯吱声、羽绒服的摩擦声、静电打人声</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2791">00:46:31</a> 雪地就是我的画布，广场上是我的作品集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3151">00:52:31</a> 厦门的冬天凉爽又浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3387">00:56:27</a> 怂恿北方朋友舔铁栏杆，这太荒谬了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">00:57:20</a> 平安夜我送出去十斤苹果！全班的平安由我守护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3908">01:05:08</a> 雪地十连摔才发现下面是花砖地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4131">01:08:51</a> 韩剧把冬天浪漫化的一塌糊涂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4401">01:13:21</a> 冬天不看纯爱电影不是浪费吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4710">01:18:30</a> 香港过圣诞，陌生人的善意让我温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4815">01:20:15</a> 东北人真正的家——三亚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4888">01:21:28</a> 西北人渴望东北粘豆包的第二年</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——BryanTeoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>첫 눈（初雪）——EXO</span></p><span></span><p><span>在冬天和奶奶一起晒太阳——赵照</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬天一个游——Gordon Flanders</span></p><span></span><p><span>소녀（少女）——吴赫</span></p><span></span><p><span>Can’t Wait ‘Til Christmas——宇多田光</span></p><span></span><p><span>Small Happiness——麗美</span></p><span></span><p><span>First Love——宇多田光</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li_ueEy5bB1ohKmpkKef2cSUmDXe.m4a" length="83953378" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl9RreLwfhQODhcghQHckGb1fBiN.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.16【别问！就是消费】——爱自己用ONLY带梵克雅宝，我有什么可怜的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6765aa341e823e72d37e43fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6765aa341e823e72d37e43fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 21 Dec 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是我们几个朋友间因不同消费习惯而展开的。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>无论是深陷消费主义陷阱、节约存钱还是享受生活，你也许会从我们身上看到自己的影子，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播:榴莲 高兴 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">00:01:29</a> 近期的大笔消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">00:06:10</a> 攒瓶子卖破烂，感觉自己很可怜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">00:10:02</a> 房价越跌，我越开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">00:14:27</a> 为了追求性价比，浪费了很多时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">00:16:32</a> 洗脑广告让我无法再信任测评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1282">00:21:22</a> 让我看看看看谁不喜欢泡泡玛特</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">00:25:20</a>保持社交距离的店员让我更有压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">00:34:57</a> 年年送朋友生日礼物还蛮累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">00:41:04</a> 后悔的消费，谁躲得过去呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2667">00:44:27</a> 拥有就祛魅是不是说明你不需要它</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">00:50:48</a> 银行限额5000，我还怎么消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3409">00:56:49</a> 微小额贷到底谁发明的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3469">00:57:49</a> 两千一张的理发卡超值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">01:08:40</a> 消费行为健康度大比拼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4708">01:18:28</a> 大家都趁年轻体验生活，但怎么就我攒不下钱啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4822">01:20:22</a> 经典环节：原生家庭对我消费观的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5221">01:27:01</a> 江浙沪独生女的幸福谁懂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5424">01:30:24</a> 不明白个人收入为啥是个很敏感的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5537">01:32:17</a> 情谊和金钱之间的价值判断，让我在友情中左右摇摆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6589">01:49:49</a> 就要消费的话，你会买什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6870">01:54:30</a> 大家都好好攒钱哦，我们明年再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——BryanTeoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>穷开心——花儿乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>林俊杰——不潮不用花钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>Love Yourself——莫文蔚</span></p><span></span><p><span>안녕 Goodbye——Dia</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果有一天我变得很有钱——毛不易</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lm2RYIZcKuFqh1k3QCHPczXq5kuc.m4a" length="117254898" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:59:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoLPbllpA1lo5fNWHiT1knzeRXO3.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.15【抽象的具体的，来的都是qie儿（下）】——管他是哆啦A梦还是马斯克 都是我朋友</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674b53d50ed328720a85fe56</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674b53d50ed328720a85fe56</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>这期播客是延续上期朋友的话题，更加具体的聊了聊面对朋友间的金钱往来怎么处理、男女间有没有纯友谊，还有朋友间奇怪的占有欲等话题</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>也许我们一直往前走才会发现，“我”才是自己最该好好爱护的朋友，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>本期节目主播:榴莲 Ary 阿山</span></p></blockquote><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a> 不会向朋友借钱是想让关系更纯粹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">00:08:20</a> 男女间到底有没有纯友谊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="989">00:16:29</a> 朋友间奇怪的占有欲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">00:21:46</a> 我需要的朋友是坚定支持我的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">00:28:34</a> 朋友对于Ary是有阶段性的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">00:30:42</a> 真吵真闹，朋友关系才能好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2486">00:41:26</a> 记忆中走丢的那些朋友们…</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2826">00:47:06</a> 大学舍友真的适合当朋友嘛?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2889">00:48:09</a> 空荡荡的宿舍,舍友带了蛋糕却没人与她分享</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">00:54:10</a> 小学被男生排挤,因此练就和女生交朋友的技能</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">01:03:03</a> 你想和谁做朋友? 漫画人物、家人还是偶像</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>I Guess What I'mTrying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><p><span>像你这样的朋友——陆虎</span></p><p><span>Mr.Lonely——玉置浩二 (たまき こうじ)</span></p><p><span>最佳损友——陈奕迅</span></p><p><span>December——Neck Deep</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li0BBdvmFhLpUjZKoGzUTsCBC1-e.m4a" length="74697458" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_W3QeEDXBU8fNTgbUC18Kk7mPk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.14【抽象的具体的，来的都是qie儿（上）】——光棍不可怕，没朋友更可怜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672dfc7143dc3a4387137a65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672dfc7143dc3a4387137a65</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是关于不同性格的人如何定义朋友，认识朋友的分享</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这期节目是去年我最初接触播客录制的一期存货。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>朋友也许是流动的，但我们身上总会留下他们的痕迹，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播:榴莲 Ary 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Ps.录制的音频确实还是会有部分的杂音和电音，但我会尽量在后续的节目中保持声音的纯净</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">00:01:47</a> 朋友更像生活的调味料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">00:05:09</a> 人不分三六九等，但我的朋友分四级六级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">00:10:21</a> 刚认识就一起唱K，不奇怪啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">00:14:27</a> 微信加新好友后要寒暄很尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">00:17:20</a> 遇到陌生人我更容易敞开心扉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">00:23:53</a> 工作让我更封闭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">00:28:17</a> 跟同事交朋友，我感觉是件很可悲的事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">00:34:20</a> 我恐惧网络组群社交</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">00:37:39</a> 男生在网络很难找搭子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2452">00:40:52</a> 从接触互联网我就基本不评论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">00:45:52</a> 不会称呼别人算不算社交障碍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2989">00:49:49</a> 我的社交很严格，会排日程表</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3252">00:54:12</a> 对朋友不分级，就看事情紧急不紧急</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3274">00:54:34</a> 点阵朋友，圆圈朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">00:56:38</a> 私货分享——世上哪有你这样的海胆</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Finally See TheLight——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>武林外传 茉莉花——Jeremy</span></p><span></span><p><span>April Front °Ending Version——松隆子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lku3Hhu3gqaEJvioJMZxLiR6pS7z.m4a" length="58271401" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgHXOecZzCGWHGBS0Phy6o_0WC63.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.13【生活碎记】——我们都一样 整天俗开心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fd79826c7f8177868c87a2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fd79826c7f8177868c87a2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是九月末我在威海看完日出后的一些感受，奔跑着感受海风和幸福，记录下和海鸥一般自由的时刻。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我在威海的最后一天去海边游了泳、喝了浓盐水，也看到海水吞噬了落日。黄昏的光晕让我很庆幸自己会开车会游泳，我感觉你会的技能多一个能感受到这个世界的美好就多一份。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>希望大家能听完这期独特的片尾曲哦，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播：阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Ps.这期我自己听像是在胡言乱语，可能太开心确实会语无伦次吧，爱慕搜骚瑞。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:00:54</a> 我又拧巴了，不会特立独行en想特立独行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="285">00:04:45</a> 凌晨三点半去网红打卡地，就是独享！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a> 看日出海天四色，见海鸥……想不出押韵了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">00:08:23</a> 在海边朝着日出狂奔也太浪漫了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">00:10:55</a> 看完日出逛早市儿，买到新鲜的无花果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">00:12:31</a> 看到了大爷大妈跳广场舞还是大合唱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">00:14:13</a> 自恃清高恨自己，落入俗套骂自己——拧巴完了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">00:16:38</a> 这精神状态完美！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsAcAYoolVQlhwBHTfeP-HQv9t-P.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最上层的云就是淡黄色！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh_4OGWsB-co-svAmU6aE8d4kT5a.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>海天四色 海鸥乱飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'mTrying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>海浪声——阿山特录</span></p><span></span><p><span>敖包相会——精神矍铄的威海老年合唱团</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrwOKcN7tHKbEKy_mkPufuxFK-lJ.m4a" length="14649918" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:03</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiu-Un8kf3rYSGg_K-Cl2Yx-IA4u.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.12【生活碎记】——学着放松 学着做自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fc251081cdab3a93607e6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fc251081cdab3a93607e6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是一个全新的专题——一个人的闲言感概。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>这期节目是我体验完“只有河南”这地以后的一些观感和感慨。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>希望大家能学着放轻松爱自己，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播：阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">00:02:12</a> 没有生活常识，分不清玉米高粱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">00:02:51</a> 我不会放松自己，活得好拧巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">00:07:25</a> 看剧的感受（不含剧透版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">00:14:05</a> 看剧很震撼，脖子加脑子全麻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">00:14:58</a> 勇敢的享受剧目真的很酷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">00:18:32</a> 别在乎别人的目光，想干啥干啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">00:22:21</a> 真实感受到了剧场设计表达的相统一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1407">00:23:27</a> 感受到剧中的人物鲜活的存在着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a> 《苏轼的河南》是我离开剧场的完美ending</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'mTrying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>夜幕降临之前——刘可</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有河南——付豪</span></p>]]></description>
