  <item>
    <title>Vol.11【演唱会不是我唱啊？】——别管其他人，该唱唱该求婚求婚</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e18755bfd7110df4ece56e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e18755bfd7110df4ece56e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 12:04:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>这期播客是我尝试了全新的剪辑手法，非常之精妙和高超，但导出后文件太大，只好上传了MP3的格式，不知道会有啥问题出现。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>这期节目像是延续了演唱会给我带来的开心，希望你也能听的开心。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>演唱会是生活中鲜活的节点，一个人看演唱也会更酷，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>本期节目主播：小葵 榴莲 阿山</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>Ps.部分片段还是存在杂音，处理了还没成功，谁能教教我啊！</span></p></blockquote><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">00:02:35</a> 陈奕迅是音色流氓哎！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">00:07:14</a> 这还用说，最喜欢王嘉尔的演唱会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">00:09:44</a> 在妈妈生日当天，和她一起看了梁静茹的演唱会</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">00:13:33</a> 我听到陈奕迅进拍进慢了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">00:24:41</a> 看演唱会必发全套朋友圈啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">00:30:58</a> 看完演唱会现找回宁波的顺风车</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2269">00:37:49</a> 看完演唱会自己要建个live歌单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2757">00:45:57</a> 李宇春在演唱会上穿的全是GUCCI高定</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3038">00:50:38</a>在演唱会上求婚很浪漫？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 拿赠票看演唱会，坐第一排也不会很开心</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4136">01:08:56</a> 看着歌词听着live，你会掉进时光隧道</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4233">01:10:33</a> 我在演唱会上给李荣浩准备惊喜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4611">01:16:51</a> 跟父母看演唱会是全新的体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4902">01:21:42</a> 关于陈奕迅演唱会的一些争议</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5913">01:38:33</a> 降低期待，用心感受演唱会的氛围就很好</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6123">01:42:03</a> 夹带的私人愤怒</span></p><p><span>BGM：</span></p><p><span>I Guess What I'mTrying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><p><span>Love Story——Taylor Swift</span></p><p><span>忘记歌词（Live）——陈奕迅</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkeH0plCDoRp1_FExJ7CR79yxQ27.m4a" length="103140201" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:45:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDCWvZa6v7BbY_9tlUE2j_8_eom.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.10【考试经历漫谈】——考不好就要背井离乡这谁受得了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6665e30e63c334a2fb6a2992</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6665e30e63c334a2fb6a2992</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 09 Jun 2024 17:14:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客的选题是因为最近参加了经纪人考试后感受很多，又恰好是高考期间，所以不聊聊考试也太可惜。这期节目是我和俱乐部的朋友们一起录制的，我们从各自经历出发回忆了美好学生时代的考试经历。本期的聊天内容中的观点、玩笑并无恶意，更无主观冒犯，如有不同观点，请友善交流。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>考试并不会代表一切，但是考试让我们了解到了不同的世界，这期播客分享给你们——我的朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目主播：小黑 榴莲 大海 阿山</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">00:01:09</a> 考了经纪人考试，发现自己不在乎考试了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">00:04:27</a> 重返大学校园满眼都是羡慕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">00:06:00</a> 工作以后也要考试，这谁顶得住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">00:09:52</a> 就是为了作弊，我才考的试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">00:15:57</a> 艺考与普通高考的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">00:19:38</a> 考试期间个人独特的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a> 经典的文理科刻板印象环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">00:26:03</a> 榴莲：不努力就去外省？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">00:31:26</a> 小黑：努力读书就是为了到大学放飞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1999">00:33:19</a> 大海：为了考好，求神拜佛就是不读书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">00:34:41</a> 阿山：我学习能力的巅峰是初三</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">00:38:25</a> 中国孩子逃不拖的高考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2742">00:45:42</a> 好好读书也翻不了天？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">00:50:08</a> 有人真的能整明白志愿填报吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">00:59:31</a>高考改革后感觉更卷了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3772">01:02:52</a> 高考查分不就是打电话查询吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4038">01:07:18</a> 来上大学以为回村了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4171">01:09:31</a> 大学里除了学习都吸引我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4751">01:19:11</a> 没挂过科能叫上过大学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5225">01:27:05</a> 因为信息差痛失保研</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5434">01:30:34</a> 毕业论文的差别怎么这么大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5795">01:36:35</a> 原来所谓的科学家就是我们的大学老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6017">01:40:17</a> 我们的工作面试全部一击即中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6531">01:48:51</a> 让你回到过去的一场考试去改变结果，你愿意吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7040">01:57:20</a> 高考不是唯一改变人生的机会，放轻松朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7202">02:00:02</a> 记得去毕业旅行哦~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'm Trying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>Trip Up North—— Bryan Teoh</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lh8E5vCfqDeUO-M3t8GRQsLaHyNi.m4a" length="120552936" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:03:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGIEE-FGb1MYAMu5Bob5Kk4z6m7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.09【小时代5：散伙时代】——同声歌唱友谊地久天长</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6625488c200abebe6e53a3ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6625488c200abebe6e53a3ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Apr 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>这期播客是我与好朋友123和鹿小葵录制的，本期的内容是延续上期我们三人的自爆局。如果没有听上期播客内容的朋友们可以先听完上期内容，再来听这期节目，这让会有更加完整的体验。如有不同观点，请友善交流。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我们的友情难得可贵但也难免有矛盾，这期播客分享给你们——听众朋友。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>内容目录：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:00:08</a> 温馨提示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">00:01:42</a> 鹿小葵接受被“讨伐”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">00:02:28</a> 123背刺我，耍滑头！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">00:03:23</a> 吐槽鹿小葵我压力好大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">00:10:22</a> 说鹿小葵的“优越感”让我语无伦次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="829">00:13:49</a> 我们真的没有吵架！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">00:18:54</a> 吐槽半天终于自己的需求是啥了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">00:21:19</a> 我发现我没有安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">00:24:50</a> 我为啥觉得123在捧臭脚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">00:27:04</a> 我无法接受夸赞的能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">00:38:52</a> 作为好朋友如何讨论男女问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2435">00:40:35</a> 我对123和鹿小葵的不满真的好多！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">00:46:11</a> 夸夸环节！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3233">00:53:53</a>我吐槽最多，收获也最多！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3760">01:02:40</a>十年后再听听看吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4007">01:06:47</a> 合唱友谊天长地久！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4130">01:08:50</a> 小彩蛋：唱歌前摇准备阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Guess What I'mTrying to Say——Bryan Teoh</span></p><span></span><p><span>友谊地久天长——黑鸭子演唱组</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgzbJed4xxDI8QqWE0GLs1CNKLls.m4a" length="68844227" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:51</itunes:duration>
